  <p>Used with <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlGetParcelDetails" target="_blank">llGetParcelDetails</a>, see <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlGetParcelFlags" target="_blank">llGetParcelFlags</a> for the meaning of the returned flags.</p>
</p>
